y document and then can be added anywhere in the document ","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]},{"id":"0,0,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,0,2,0","type":4,"elements":"(except for the place inside another code block) using the \"Insert calculator\" button or the ","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]},{"id":"0,0,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,0,3,0","type":4,"elements":"key combination [Ctrl+Shift+C]. A calculator block also appears when you start entering ","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]},{"id":"0,0,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,0,4,0","type":4,"elements":"formulas using the math panel buttons, if the cursor is not in block at that moment.","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]}],"format_name":"Text body","format_alignment":0},{"id":"0,1","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1,0,0","type":4,"elements":"There can be as many calculator blocks as you like and they form a single space for ","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]},{"id":"0,1,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1,1,0","type":4,"elements":"solving between themselves. This means, in particular, that variables and functions ","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]},{"id":"0,1,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1,2,0","type":4,"elements":"declared in the block above can be used in the block below.","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]}],"format_name":"Text body","format_alignment":0},{"id":"0,2","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,2,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,2,0,0","type":4,"elements":"These blocks can be copied to the clipboard like any other symbols. If a mathematical ","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]},{"id":"0,2,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,2,1,0","type":4,"elements":"expression from a block is copied to text, a calculator block will automatically appear.","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]}],"format_name":"Text body","format_alignment":0},{"id":"0,3","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,3,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,3,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Text outside these blocks does not affect calculations in any way.","format_id":"848cca29-bd4d-4661-88e0-760d37b864f5"}]}],"format_name":"Text body","format_alignment":0}]},"caret":{"id":"0,3,0,66"},"selection":[]}